{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05889","headline":"谒璿上人 · 王维","name":"谒璿上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年不足言，识道年已长。\n事往安可悔，余生幸能养。\n誓从断臂血，不复婴世网。\n浮名寄缨佩，空性无羁鞅。\n夙承大导师，焚香此瞻仰。\n颓然居一室，覆载纷万象。\n高柳早鸎啼，长廊春雨响。\n牀下阮家屐，窗前筇竹杖。\n方将见身云，陋彼示天壤。\n一心在法要，愿以无生奖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}